{"seq":2,"slug":"coyote-leniency","title":"土狼时间与宽容窗","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-input-systems/feel/coyote-leniency","wordCount":1635,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"土狼时间与宽容窗\">土狼时间与宽容窗</h1><p>玩家明明在踩到平台边缘的瞬间按了跳，角色却已经踏空坠落——按物理判定他晚了一帧，但他的眼睛和手都确信&quot;我还站在台子上&quot;。土狼时间（coyote time，得名于踏空后悬在空中才坠落的卡通土狼）允许角色离开地面后的几十毫秒内仍能起跳，把这种&quot;差一点&quot;判成&quot;算你过&quot;。它和一族&quot;宽容窗&quot;机制共享同一个底层洞察：人对时机的感知有系统性误差，硬规则应该向这个误差让步，而不是惩罚它。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>宽容机制的共同结构是：把一个本来&quot;非此即彼&quot;的硬判定，改成&quot;在边界附近开一个容错窗口&quot;。土狼时间在&quot;离地&quot;这个状态转换后延迟生效跳跃禁令；跳跃缓冲在&quot;落地&quot;前提前接收跳跃（这是 <a href=\"input-buffering\">输入缓冲</a> 的特例）；命中宽容窗在&quot;判定帧&quot;前后扩一点容差。它们都把一个时刻点扩成一段时间窗。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[角色离开地面] --&gt; B[启动土狼计时器&lt;br/&gt;coyoteTimer = W]&#10;  B --&gt; C[每帧递减计时器]&#10;  C --&gt; D{玩家按跳跃}&#10;  D --&gt;|是 且 计时器 大于 0| E[允许起跳&lt;br/&gt;视作还在地面]&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F{计时器归零}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[真正进入下落态&lt;br/&gt;不能再跳]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| C\">flowchart TD\n  A[角色离开地面] --&gt; B[启动土狼计时器&lt;br/&gt;coyoteTimer = W]\n  B --&gt; C[每帧递减计时器]\n  C --&gt; D{玩家按跳跃}\n  D --&gt;|是 且 计时器 大于 0| E[允许起跳&lt;br/&gt;视作还在地面]\n  D --&gt;|否| F{计时器归零}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[真正进入下落态&lt;br/&gt;不能再跳]\n  F --&gt;|否| C</pre><p>土狼时间与跳跃缓冲是一对镜像——一个容许&quot;晚按&quot;，一个容许&quot;早按&quot;，合起来把跳跃的可接受时机从一个瞬间扩成一段区间：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>可跳区间</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>离地</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>buffer</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>离地</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>coyote</mtext></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{可跳区间} = [\\,t_{\\text{离地}} - W_{\\text{buffer}},\\ t_{\\text{离地}} + W_{\\text{coyote}}\\,]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">可跳区间</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">离地</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">buffer</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">离地</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">coyote</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>下表对比这一族宽容机制，它们机理相通但作用于不同状态转换：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>容许什么</th>\n<th>作用对象</th>\n<th>典型窗口</th>\n<th>误调后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>土狼时间</td>\n<td>离地后仍能跳</td>\n<td>跳跃</td>\n<td>80~120ms</td>\n<td>太长则&quot;凌空跳&quot;穿帮</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跳跃缓冲</td>\n<td>落地前的跳输入</td>\n<td>跳跃</td>\n<td>100~150ms</td>\n<td>太长则落地连跳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>命中宽容窗</td>\n<td>判定帧前后的命中</td>\n<td>攻击/招架</td>\n<td>1~3 帧</td>\n<td>太长则无脑招架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转角宽容</td>\n<td>边缘踏空的横向修正</td>\n<td>移动</td>\n<td>几帧</td>\n<td>太长则&quot;吸附&quot;穿帮</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"土狼时间的实现与边角\">土狼时间的实现与边角</h2><p>土狼时间的实现极简：离地时启动一个计时器，每帧递减，跳跃判定时不仅看&quot;是否在地面&quot;，还看&quot;土狼计时器是否仍大于 0&quot;。但简洁的实现藏着几个必须处理的边角，否则会出 bug。</p>\n<p>最关键的是<strong>区分&quot;走下平台&quot;和&quot;主动跳跃后离地&quot;</strong>。玩家主动跳起后角色也&quot;离地&quot;了，若此时还给土狼时间，就会出现&quot;跳起后在空中又能再跳一次&quot;的二段跳 bug。所以启动土狼计时器的条件应是&quot;从地面态因非跳跃原因转入空中态&quot;，跳跃本身要立即清零土狼计时器。另一个边角是计时器应在重新落地时复位，以及在被屏蔽上下文（见 <a href=\"../mapping/input-contexts\">输入上下文与栈</a>）下不应继续累积。这些边角不处理，土狼时间就从&quot;提升手感&quot;变成&quot;引入诡异 bug&quot;。把边角编码进状态更新，逻辑就很短：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"struct Player { bool onGround; bool jumpedThisFrame; float coyoteTimer; };&#10;&#10;void update(float dt, bool jumpPressed, float W_coyote, float W_buffer) {&#10;    if (onGround)            coyoteTimer = W_coyote;          // 在地面：计时器满格&#10;    else if (jumpedThisFrame) coyoteTimer = 0.f;              // 主动跳起：立即清零，防二段跳&#10;    else                     coyoteTimer -= dt;               // 走下平台：递减&#10;&#10;    if (jumpPressed &amp;&amp; (onGround || coyoteTimer &gt; 0.f)) {&#10;        doJump();&#10;        jumpedThisFrame = true;&#10;        coyoteTimer = 0.f;                                    // 兑现后清零&#10;    }&#10;    if (onGround) jumpedThisFrame = false;                    // 落地复位&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Player</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> onGround; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> jumpedThisFrame; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coyoteTimer; };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> dt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> jumpPressed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> W_coyote</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> W_buffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (onGround)            coyoteTimer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> W_coyote;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          // 在地面：计时器满格</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    else</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (jumpedThisFrame) coyoteTimer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">              // 主动跳起：立即清零，防二段跳</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                     coyoteTimer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">               // 走下平台：递减</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (jumpPressed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (onGround </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coyoteTimer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        doJump</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        jumpedThisFrame </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        coyoteTimer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                                    // 兑现后清零</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (onGround) jumpedThisFrame </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                    // 落地复位</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键行是 <code>jumpedThisFrame</code> 那一支：只有&quot;因跳跃主动离地&quot;才清零计时器，而&quot;走下平台&quot;走的是递减分支，于是二段跳 bug 被源码结构本身排除。</p>\n<h2 id=\"宽容是体验而非作弊\">宽容是体验而非作弊</h2><p>设计宽容窗最大的认知误区，是把它当成&quot;对玩家放水&quot;。恰恰相反：宽容窗补偿的是人类感知与机器离散时序之间的<strong>固有鸿沟</strong>，目的是让游戏的行为匹配玩家的真实意图，而非降低难度。研究与经验都表明，玩家几乎察觉不到合理范围内的宽容窗存在——他们只会觉得&quot;这游戏手感真好&quot;。去掉它，玩家则会把自己的感知误差归咎于游戏&quot;不跟手&quot;。</p>\n<p>这带来一条设计准则：<strong>宽容窗应该隐形</strong>。窗口要紧贴人类误差分布的合理范围（土狼时间常在 6~8 帧即约 100ms），一旦明显超出，玩家就会从潜意识里感知到不一致——&quot;我明明早就掉下去了怎么还能跳&quot;，反而破坏沉浸。竞技性游戏会把窗口收得更紧甚至可配置，以保证技术天花板；休闲游戏则放宽以降低挫败。值得强调，宽容窗与无障碍中的&quot;输入辅助&quot;（如自动连发、保持切换）是不同层面的东西——前者对所有玩家隐形生效，后者是玩家显式开启的辅助选项，详见 <a href=\"../practice/input-accessibility\">输入无障碍</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在更广动作里的宽容窗\">在更广动作里的宽容窗</h2><p>跳跃只是宽容机制最有名的应用，同一思路渗透到几乎所有强调手感的玩法。格斗游戏的&quot;招架/弹反&quot;开一个 1~3 帧的命中宽容窗，让完美防御从&quot;逐帧精确&quot;变成&quot;在大致时机按下&quot;；动作游戏的&quot;极限闪避&quot;在敌人攻击命中前后开窗触发子弹时间；横版游戏给跳跃落点做&quot;转角宽容&quot;，玩家擦着平台边缘也能站上去而非滑落。</p>\n<p>这些宽容窗与 <a href=\"input-buffering\">输入缓冲</a> 经常叠加使用：缓冲负责接住提前的输入，宽容窗负责放宽兑现的时机判定，二者一前一后把&quot;精确时机&quot;彻底磨成&quot;舒适区间&quot;。落到工程上，所有这些窗都应以定点 tick 计量（理由同 <a href=\"../foundations/input-pipeline\">输入流水线</a> 的确定性讨论），并暴露为可调参数让设计师手感调优。命中宽容窗的具体判定虽在输入侧开窗，但命中的伤害与帧数结算属于 <a href=\"../../combat-system-design/foundations/action-states-frame-data\">战斗系统设计</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>宽容机制把&quot;非此即彼&quot;的硬判定改成边界附近的容错窗，土狼时间、跳跃缓冲、命中宽容窗共享这一结构。</li>\n<li>土狼时间允许离地后几十毫秒仍能跳，与跳跃缓冲互为镜像，把跳跃时机从瞬间扩成区间。</li>\n<li>实现极简（离地启计时器、跳跃判定加查计时器），但必须区分&quot;走下平台&quot;与&quot;主动跳起&quot;，否则出二段跳 bug。</li>\n<li>宽容窗补偿人类感知与离散时序的固有鸿沟，目的是匹配意图而非放水，应隐形——紧贴误差分布，超出则穿帮。</li>\n<li>思路渗透到招架、极限闪避、转角宽容等所有手感玩法，常与输入缓冲叠加，须以定点 tick 计量并暴露为可调参数。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸阅读：本篇与 <a href=\"input-buffering\">输入缓冲与意图</a> 互补（一容晚按一容早按），计时依赖 <a href=\"../foundations/input-pipeline\">输入流水线</a>，边角涉及 <a href=\"../mapping/input-contexts\">输入上下文与栈</a>。跨库见 <a href=\"../../combat-system-design/foundations/action-states-frame-data\">动作状态与帧数</a> 与玩家显式辅助的 <a href=\"../../game-accessibility/interaction/difficulty-assists\">难度辅助</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"土狼时间与宽容窗","id":"土狼时间与宽容窗"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"土狼时间的实现与边角","id":"土狼时间的实现与边角"},{"level":2,"text":"宽容是体验而非作弊","id":"宽容是体验而非作弊"},{"level":2,"text":"在更广动作里的宽容窗","id":"在更广动作里的宽容窗"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"输入缓冲与意图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-input-systems/feel/input-buffering"},"next":{"title":"连招与手势识别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-input-systems/feel/combo-gesture"}}